            ]
          },
          "abstract": "<jats:title>Abstract</jats:title>\n                <jats:p>GTEx_Pro is a Nextflow-based pipeline for preprocessing GTEx v8 transcriptomic data, enhancing multi-tissue comparability. It integrates TMM + CPM normalization and SVA batch effect correction to improve biological signal recovery while reducing systematic variations across 54 GTEx tissues. Designed for scalability and reproducibility, GTEx_Pro facilitates accurate multi-tissue transcriptomic analysis and a similar framework can be adapted to other large-scale transcriptome datasets.</jats:p>",
          "type": "posted-content",
          "URL": "https://doi.org/10.1101/2025.04.26.650748"
